{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_01",
      "hash": "3d47d4f9e0a468a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哦！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_02",
      "hash": "3d47d1f9e0a46388",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你也让助手\\n教你学会了“炫光闪”吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_03",
      "hash": "3d47d2f9e0a4653b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……什么？不是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你，而是\\n[VAR PKNICK(0003)]学会了“炫光闪”吗！？\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你的搭档\\n依然这么厉害啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_10",
      "hash": "3d4b59f9e0a78077",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊！我知道一个地方，\\n可以让你施展炫光闪哦！\\r\\n要我带你去那附近吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_01",
      "hash": "7d683be3eb91c217",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我们一起去吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_02",
      "hash": "7d683ce3eb91c3ca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "让我自己去吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_04",
      "hash": "3d47d7f9e0a46dba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦！那我马上带你去！\\c\\n我们走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_05",
      "hash": "3d47d8f9e0a46f6d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "从这里华蓝市\\n往东边……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_06",
      "hash": "3d47d5f9e0a46a54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是这边啦！\\c\\n从这边一～直往前走，\\n说是有个叫[VAR COLOR(0006)]岩山隧道[VAR COLOR(0000)]的\\r\\n漆黑一片的地方！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_07",
      "hash": "3d47d6f9e0a46c07",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要用“炫光闪”照亮周围，\\n就不需要怕黑了！\\c\\n那再见咯！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_08",
      "hash": "3d47cbf9e0a45956",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唉……！是嘛。\\c\\n……你确定一个人没关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_03",
      "hash": "7d683de3eb91c57d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我想一个人去"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0475_select_04",
      "hash": "7d6836e3eb91b998",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "还是一起去吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0475_rival_09",
      "hash": "3d47ccf9e0a45b09",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好吧！但我还是说清楚好了。\\c\\n从[VAR COLOR(0006)]华蓝市[VAR COLOR(0000)]一直往东走，\\c\\n说是有个叫[VAR COLOR(0006)]岩山隧道[VAR COLOR(0000)]的\\n漆黑一片的地方！\\c\\n那再见咯！\\n路上小心！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0475_max",
      "hash": "847641bc3d63e8ef"
    }
  ]
}
